  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You consume XXX grams of protein daily. A balanced diet requires at least YYY grams of protein per day.\n\nDetermine whether your daily protein intake fulfills the recommended requirement. The daily protein intake is considered fulfilled if and only if XXX is greater than or equal to YYY.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input contains two space-separated integers XXX and YYY - the grams of protein consumed daily and the minimum grams of protein recommended respectively.\n\n\nOutput Format\nPrint `YES` if the daily protein intake meets or exceeds the recommended amount.\n\nOtherwise, print `NO`.\n\n\nEach letter of the output may be printed in either uppercase or lowercase, i.e, the strings `NO`, `no`, `No`, and `nO` will all be treated as equivalent.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤X,Y≤1001 \\leq X, Y \\leq 1001≤X,Y≤100"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "80 65",
        "output": "YES",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nSince X=80X = 80X=80 is greater than Y=65Y = 65Y=65, daily protein intake is fulfilled."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "16 49",
        "output": "NO",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nSince X=16X = 16X=16 is less than Y=49Y = 49Y=49, daily protein intake is not fulfilled."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_3",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "10 10",
        "output": "YES",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nSince X=10X = 10X=10 is equal to Y=10Y = 10Y=10, daily protein intake is fulfilled."
      }
    ]
  },
